r4\":{\"seed\":1942029223,\"fieldTufts\":384606,\"tufts\":15126,\"blades\":110692,\"drawCalls\":8,\"nearBlades\":0,\"middleBlades\":28244,\"farBlades\":82448}},\"protected13\":{\"foreground-trunk\":{\"roi\":[666,504,679,533],\"meanAbsRGB255\":0.0,\"count\":377},\"lamp-pole\":{\"roi\":[157,522,163,575],\"meanAbsRGB255\":0.0,\"count\":318},\"green-cover\":{\"roi\":[706,613,740,623],\"meanAbsRGB255\":0.0,\"count\":340},\"paving\":{\"roi\":[225,668,286,680],\"meanAbsRGB255\":0.0,\"count\":732}},\"browserExceptionCount\":0,\"mobile\":{\"viewport\":390,\"page\":390,\"canvas\":352.90625,\"blades\":\"105,028\"},\"sameProjection\":true},\"sourceExcerpt\":{\"file\":\"lib/capture-meadow.test.mjs\",\"sha256\":\"a579edd112a7532023ede291f6c3074c86360087539636e69fd87e6a4e231d60\",\"lines\":[{\"first\":58,\"last\":100,\"code\":\"// of the tuft generator's hash, scaling and rotation transforms.\\ntest('fine-detail population tapers in metres without a jump in slope at either end', () => {\\n  for(const [near,far] of [[3.7,5.3],[10.5,14.5]]){\\n    let prev=1;\\n    for(let i=0;i<=100;i++){\\n      const distance=near+(far-near)*i/100,w=meadowDetailMix(distance,near,far);\\n      assert.ok(w>=0 && w<=prev);prev=w;\\n    }\\n    assert.equal(meadowDetailMix(near-.2,near,far),1);\\n    assert.equal(meadowDetailMix(far+.2,near,far),0);\\n    assert.ok(1-meadowDetailMix(near+.001,near,far)<.00001);\\n    assert.ok(meadowDetailMix(far-.001,near,far)<.00001);\\n  }\\n  assert.equal(meadowDetailMix(4,5,5),0);\\n});\\n\\ntest('coarser LOD retains the same individual blade sockets, tips and colors', () => {\\n  const field=createCaptureMeadow();\\n  const camera=new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-40,40,40,-40,.01,160);\\n  moveCamera(camera,0,-4,1.2);\\n  const snapshot=field.exportSnapshot(camera);\\n  for(let variant=1;variant<=4;variant++){\\n    const geom=tier=>snapshot.getObjectByName('Turf blades '+tier+' '+variant).geometry;\\n    const near=geom('near'),mid=geom('middle'),far=geom('far');\\n    for(const id of far.userData.sourceBladeIds)assert.ok(mid.userData.sourceBladeIds.includes(id));\\n    for(const detail of [mid,far]){\\n      const rows=detail===mid?[0,1,3]:[0,3];\\n      for(const [blade,id] of detail.userData.sourceBladeIds.entries()){\\n        for(const [row,nearRow] of rows.entries())for(const side of [0,1])for(const attr of ['position','color']){\\n          const ni=3*((id*4+nearRow)*3+side*2),di=3*((blade*rows.length+row)*2+side);\\n          assert.deepEqual([...detail.attributes[attr].array.slice(di,di+3)], [...near.attributes[attr].array.slice(ni,ni+3)]);\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n  for(const mesh of snapshot.children)mesh.dispose();\\n  field.dispose();\\n});\\n\\ntest('all active tiers stay within the .108 m clearance at ±12 m/s and wind returns to rest', () => {\\n  const field=createCaptureMeadow(), {layout}=field;\\n  const camera=new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-5,5,5,-5,.01,160);\\n  moveCamera(camera,0,-4,1.2);\"}]},\"actualStageBHandoffs\":[{\"taskId\":\"lawn-r4-b-qa\",\"responseSha256\":\"e6eef5d1044b4e62d234a46da4f54c277f103a9e24ce26696d806552e95d45d4\",\"responseText\":\"{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"accept_wrap_trial\\\",\\n  \\\"expression\\\": \\\"1 if tolerance >= 0 and new_x <= old_x + 1e-9 and new_y <= old_y + 1e-9 and (old_x - new_x > 1e-9 or old_y - new_y > 1e-9) and abs(detail_change) <= tolerance else 0\\\",\\n  \\\"implementation\\\": \\\"在第二轮像素缓冲区试验中，将修改前后水平、垂直 meanExcess 分别传入 old_x、old_y、new_x、new_y；detail_change 取修改后减修改前的 nearBorderDirectionalMean，tolerance 使用同量纲的预设容差。对所给首轮数据，两纹理的 detail_change 分别约为 3.0134505936329e-5 和 7.7859153861884e-5；各自容差达到其绝对变化量时返回1，否则返回0。\\\",\\n  \\\"limits\\\": \\\"超额均值须为有限非负数，detail_change 与 tolerance 须为有限实数；负容差返回0。依据是用户提供的实际嵌入纹理首轮CPU试验统计，不是相机渲染；未自行读取像素、核验哈希或执行第二轮试验。返回1仅表示重复边界与细节变化联合门限通过，不代表内部图集或材质接缝已消除，也不代表全场景验收通过。\\\"\\n}\"},{\"taskId\":\"lawn-r4-b-tone\",\"responseSha256\":\"66ac66178036f195890b9479b5ca942cdd9fb53e424ab7062bf4428088078400\",\"responseText\":\"{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"edge_correct\\\",\\n  \\\"expression\\\": \\\"min(1, max(0, sample + (opposite - edge) * weight / 2))\\\",\\n  \\\"implementation\\\": \\\"在线性 RGB 中逐通道使用。先完成首轮整体色调处理，再冻结像素缓冲，从中读取同材质的成对边缘值 edge、opposite；两侧交换这两个输入，使用相同的渐隐权重。可沿用所给试验的 12 像素边带：边界 weight=1，向内部平滑降至 0。边界两侧均变为原边缘值的平均值。此步骤为首轮 lawn_shade 增加重复边界修正，不在暗部逐像素求增益比；输出写入独立缓冲，供第二轮像素试验使用。\\\",\\n  \\\"limits\\\": \\\"要求输入为有限实数，RGB 值及 weight 在 [0,1]。内部 weight=0 时不变；裁剪可能损失细节，双轴角点须协调处理并复测，边界值相等也不保证纹理方向或导数连续。此法不能修复内部图集接缝、配准、几何或真实光照。用户提供的两张实际项目纹理首轮 CPU A/B 报告显示双向重复边界差降至零、内部最大变化为零；这是固定纹理像素试验而非相机渲染。我未独立读取纹理或执行第二轮试验，不能据此宣称整片草坪的可见接缝已消除。\\\"\\n}\"},{\"taskId\":\"lawn-r4-b-contact\",\"responseSha256\":\"35885ca95c4d45ec790ba609d29797d0837a94f915df205922e9b7ebbd3905f3\",\"responseText\":\"{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"eligible_pair\\\",\\n  \\\"expression\\\": \\\"1 if left_turf == 1 and right_turf == 1 and left_blocked == 0 and right_blocked == 0 else 0\\\",\\n  \\\"implementation\\\": \\\"供第二轮固定输入的像素缓冲试验接入：对已确认同材质的边界像素对传入四个 0/1 标记；仅返回 1 时应用修正，返回 0 时两侧均保留原值。缺失元数据由上游拒绝，不默认放行。\\\",\\n  \\\"limits\\\": \\\"孤立草坪图集内的放行不代表场景地面可放行；场景仍须提供可靠的草坪分类及铺装、保护对象遮罩。提供的证据报告了两张实际嵌入纹理的 CPU A/B 试验，仅支持重复边界指标改善，不能证明整片草坪可见接缝已解决。本次未读取纹理或执行第二轮试验，既有测试数量不构成本函数的实测结果。\\\"\\n}\"}],\"stageBUseAndScope\":\"B was tested on repeated borders of the two old textures. The R4 candidate instead integrates stage A feather/tone on a single world material, and detail_mix in viewer LOD. This review is of the entire rendered R4.\",\"requiredChecks\":{\"shadeErrorDelta01\":{\"actual\":-0.853998294,\"operator\":\"lt\",\"limit\":0,\"unit\":\"ratio difference\",\"whatItTests\":\"absolute shadow/sun ratio error against same-camera photo improves from R3\"},\"northMeanDelta01\":{\"actual\":-0.006881785,\"operator\":\"lt\",\"limit\":0,\"unit\":\"linear luminance\",\"whatItTests\":\"north-boundary mean excess across frozen paired neighborhoods decreases\"},\"protectedMax01\":{\"actual\":0.0,\"operator\":\"eq\",\"limit\":0,\"unit\":\"sRGB code values\",\"whatItTests\":\"tested b